=== Constant-Cohn nonentry gate ===
R=M has (a,b,c,d)=(3,8,1,3), epsilon=3, epsilon^2-1=8.
THM-3726 constant equations have no solution; b,c!=0 triggers THM-3736 nonconstant nonentry.

=== Scope ===
The Pell update supplies an exact typed C14 conic clock and a half-angle P1 address.
It loses owner, root chart, temporal word, target positivity, and every JC polynomial target packet.
No LRC(14), planar Jacobian, or constant-Cohn closure follows.
